This product includes software developed as part of the
deepseek-ai/chat-demo project.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/chat-demo
  License:   MIT
  Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek

The upstream MIT license text and copyright notice are retained verbatim in
app/LICENSE (the front-end source tree) and are reproduced in this repository's
LICENSE obligations. The upstream NOTICE is retained in app/NOTICE.

`app/` is a modified copy of the upstream front end. Modifications include:

  - a runtime-configurable API origin (build-time constant replaced by a
    settings-driven value), instead of a fixed build-time endpoint;
  - account login, registration and an authentication gate;
  - cloud session and attachment synchronisation against a self-hosted backend;
  - voice input/output wiring and server-side speech endpoints;
  - rebranding (DGX Chat), default locale and icons.

`android/` is a Capacitor shell that wraps the built web bundle; it contains no
upstream source code.

Third-party runtime dependencies are listed in app/package.json,
android/package.json and server/requirements*.txt, and keep their own licenses.
